# Duskwood - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 6 confirmed flagged rares of Duskwood and
# its fixed world containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of
# the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper
# is the rare. Ordinary greens get a note, not a goal. Four of the six rares
# sit above the core band (levels 31-34 vs 17-28): their steps say so
# plainly — come back at a higher level. No tame lines ship (the data has no
# tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration — see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of
# any core-contracted quest (Lupos also drops the Lean Wolf Flank and Naraxis
# the Vial of Spider Venom and Gooey Spider Legs that core hunts need —
# noted, never accepted here). Classic Duskwood names without the rare flag
# in the data (Mor'Ladim, Stitches, Stalvan, Eliza, Morbent Fel) are
# deliberately excluded — see docs/duskwood-companions-inventory.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/duskwood-rares
title Duskwood - Rares & Treasures
levels 17-28
zone Duskwood
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords duskwood, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Naraxis — the far east

  zone map 1431

  goto 86.36,47.57
  kill 574 optional
  collect 4448 "Husk of Naraxis" optional
  collect 4449 "Naraxis' Fang" optional
  note Level 27 rare spider at its single confirmed point in the far east, past Raven Hill; its sole drops are the Husk of Naraxis and Naraxis' Fang. No quest takes either in the data.
  note It also drops the Vial of Spider Venom and Gooey Spider Legs that the core guide's hunts need — duskwood.guide owns those quests; this guide never accepts them.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

